    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Imaging of von Hippel&ndash;Lindau syndrome",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Imaging of a patient with von Hippel&ndash;Lindau syndrome identifies multiple lesions. <strong>Left panel:</strong> The bilateral enhancing adrenal lesions (upper arrows) are suspicious for phaeochromocytoma, the left renal lesion (lower arrow) is most likely renal cell carcinoma, and there are multiple pancreatic cysts (not shown). <strong>Right panel:</strong> The central spinal canal enhancing mass lesions (arrows) are most likely haemangioblastomas.",
    "source": "Shereen Ezzat",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
